        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix: zhipu silentOverflow + cron watchdog stage misclassification",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\n### 1. Zhipu provider GLM models falsely flagged as overflow-prone\n\nDennis (zhipu/GLM-5.2) transcripts were wedging because `isSilentOverflowProneModel` in `agent-settings.ts` uses model ID prefix matching (`glm-*`) to disable SDK auto-compaction, but doesn't consider the provider. Zhipu's GLM models handle overflow through their own SDK mechanism and should not be flagged as overflow-prone.\n\n**Wedge mechanism**: When `silentOverflowProneModel` returns true, the SDK skips auto-compaction. For Dennis using GLM-5.2, this causes the conversation context to grow unbounded until hitting the model's `contextWindow`, at which point the transcript wedges.\n\n**Fix**: Added early exit at the top of `isSilentOverflowProneModel`:\n```ts\nif (provider === zhipu) return false;\n```\nThis ensures any zhipu model (GLM-5.2, GLM-4, etc.) is not flagged as overflow-prone regardless of model ID pattern. Added JSDoc documentation and regression tests for bare `glm-`, `glm-4`, and `z-ai/` prefixed model IDs.\n\n### 2. Cron watchdog pre-execution timeout fires spuriously\n\nThe cron watchdog's `CRON_AGENT_PHASE_WATCHDOG_STAGE` mapped three phases as `pre_execution`:\n- `model_resolution`\n- `auth`\n- `context_engine`\n\nThis kept the watchdog in `waiting_for_execution` state after the agent progressed past setup, causing the pre-execution timeout to fire spuriously during normal startup.\n\n**Fix**: Changed three values from `pre_execution` to `execution` in `src/cron/service/agent-watchdog.ts`, ensuring the watchdog correctly transitions to `executing` state and clears the pre-execution timeout when these phases are reached. Updated the related regression test in `src/cron/service/timer.regression.test.ts` to use a remaining pre-execution phase (`runtime_plugins`) for the `#74803` stall test.\n\n## Evidence\n\n### Agent-settings tests\n```\nnpx vitest run src/agents/agent-settings.test.ts\n```\nAll tests pass including new regression tests for bare `glm-`, `glm-4`, and `z-ai/` prefixed model IDs.\n\n### Watchdog tests\n```\nnpx vitest run src/cron/service/agent-watchdog.test.ts\n```\n2 passed (160ms).\n\n### Watchdog regression tests\n```\nnpx vitest run src/cron/service/timer.regression.test.ts\n```\nAll 358 tests pass including the updated `#74803` test.\n\n### Changeset\n- `src/agents/agent-settings.ts` 鈥?early exit for zhipu provider\n- `src/agents/agent-settings.test.ts` 鈥?regression tests for zhipu+GLM pattern matching\n- `src/cron/service/agent-watchdog.ts` 鈥?move model_resolution/auth/context_engine to execution stage\n- `src/cron/service/timer.regression.test.ts` 鈥?update #74803 test to use runtime_plugins phase\n",
        "branch": "main",
